        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m11" value="Servidor valida:&#xa;15: JWT + sessao + serial &gt; last_serial&#xa;16: decifra com sessionKey&#xa;17: pubkey_for_user(uid) == clientDsaPub  [bloqueia first-use injection]&#xa;18: ml_dsa65.verify(pub, payload, sig)&#xa;19: canonical v2 byte-a-byte&#xa;20: |now - timestamp| <= 30s&#xa;21: RPC executar_transferencia_atomica  (SELECT FOR UPDATE, UNIQUE txId)&#xa;22: UPDATE sessions.last_serial = serial" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#0d6efd;fillColor=#cfe2ff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4" vertex="1" parent="1">
