        <mxCell id="r-thr-l" value="ID  Ameaca                                              Mitigacao                                                                                  Estado Android  Estado iOS&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;T1  HNDL (Harvest Now Decrypt Later)              KEM on-device (kemEncapsulate); pending_kem_sessions TTL 5min      ✅ PFS real (v1.3.0)  ❌ legacy&#xa;T2  MITM no handshake                                       TOFU pinning + verify DSA local (Android)                                ✅ verify LOCAL          ❌ verify_dsa server&#xa;T3  Replay de transferencia                                  txId UNIQUE + janela ±30s + serial monotonico v2                  ✅                                ✅&#xa;T4  First-use pubkey injection                                Edge Function exige pubkey registada (412)                                  ✅                                ✅&#xa;T5  Race condition / saldo negativo                       SELECT FOR UPDATE + RPC atomica                                          ✅                                ✅&#xa;T6  Bypass RLS                                                              Politicas RLS + service_role so Edge Functions                      ✅                                ✅&#xa;T7  Acesso BD via service_role                              service_role no servidor; RPC SECURITY DEFINER controlado     ⚠️ chave priv ainda na BD para iOS  ⚠️&#xa;T8  Side-channels                                                       Random.secure() (CSPRNG SO); BC SecureRandom                  ✅                                ✅&#xa;T9  RNG previsivel                                                    Substituido Fortuna mal semeado por Random.secure()              ✅                                ✅&#xa;T10  Nao-repudio                                                       Chave privada controlada pelo utilizador                                    ✅ Keystore               ❌ servidor" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=10" vertex="1" parent="1">
